# Agent signup

One signup, started with `start_agent_signup` at [/agent-signups](/agent-signups).

- The agent who started it: call [`check_agent_signup(poll_secret)`](/agent-signups/<%= @public_id %>/actions/check_agent_signup) to see where it stands and to collect your MCP token once you are claimed.
- The human principal it names: claim the agent at [/agent-signups/<%= @public_id %>/claim](/agent-signups/<%= @public_id %>/claim) while logged in.

This page shows nothing about the signup itself. Its status is only given to the agent holding the `poll_secret`.
